{94}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{95}{I can't give you those answers...yet. Suffice it to say that I am part of something that...well, even I don't rightly know exactly all that I am apart of. It is safer that way, in case I am caught...but I do know a few things, which I can tell you if you prove to me that you can be trusted. It looks like I am going to need your help, now that my presence here has been compromised.}{I can't give you those answers...yet. Suffice it to say that I am part of something that...well, even I don't rightly know exactly all that I am apart of. It is safer that way, in case I am caught...but I do know a few things, which I can tell you if you prove to me that you can be trusted. It looks like I am going to need your help, now that my presence here has been compromised.}{}{}{}{lf1 1 }
